&lt;p&gt;I toured the City today to pick up some of my unfound Caps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for bringing me to this location OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;12 of 14&lt;/p&gt;

